MioHyphen
Copyright 2026 Readmio

This product includes software developed at Readmio.

The hyphenation algorithm is a pure-Kotlin reimplementation of Liang's TeX
hyphenation algorithm, based on the "pyphen" reference implementation.

This product bundles hyphenation pattern dictionaries (`hyph_*.dic`) from the
LibreOffice dictionaries project, which are tri-licensed under GPL 2.0 / LGPL
2.1 / MPL 1.1. Each language ships its own `README_hyph_*.txt` with per-language
credits and licensing. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
